From: DaffyDabz <daffydabz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:03:36 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 003/371] pirates: ships - client ship parts, cannons,
 boarding, pilot (Sept 2026 family-server fixes)

- shipparts (BowSprit, Cabin, Hull, Mast, Sail, ShipDecor, Shippart,
  SteeringWheel): a part can arrive before its ship (e.g. arriving next to
  other ships). Wait for the ship instead of raising KeyError, and skip setup
  for a part that was deleted while still waiting.
- DistributedShipCannon, DistributedPCCannon, DistributedShipBroadside: same
  early-arrival and deleted-before-ship guards; muzzle effects parent under
  ship.root, never modelGeom, so flattening the hull cannot merge pooled
  effects into a scene-graph cycle that crashed the client.
- DistributedShip: hand the controls back when the ship is deleted under the
  pilot; boarding movie for crewmates already aboard no longer waits on
  boardingInProgress, so the last to board sees them.
- ShipPilot2: thrust no longer scaled by dt twice, so speed does not depend on
  frame rate; debug prints removed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
